<title>GERMANY: HOCKEY-WOMEN'S CHAMPIONS' TROPHY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-WOMEN'S CHAMPIONS' TROPHY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the women's</p>
<p>Champions' Trophy hockey tourmanent on Sunday:</p>
<p>United States 1 South Korea 0 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Carla Tagiente 39</p>
<p>Netherlands 1 Britain 0 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Ellen Kuipers 17</p>
